     "q": "Do you supply Water for Injection (WFI)?",
     "a": "No: we supply a Purified Water (PW) package in polypropylene, not Water for Injection (WFI), pure steam or stainless steel. It covers pretreatment, reverse osmosis, deionization or electrodeionization, and distribution; no stills. Where your product needs WFI, you generate it; PW is the usual feed to a WFI still."
