     "q": "Do natural health products or cosmetics need PW?",
     "a": "Not always. Under Health Canada’s GUI-0158, natural health products need potable water at minimum. Purified Water (PW) is needed where the specification or a monograph calls for it. For cosmetics, the product’s legal class sets the grade: cosmetic-only lines follow your written specification; any drug line needs PW.",
